OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHigh level
OL,6,Fcloud will lead to a bright but hazy
OL,7,Fevening for many. Dry overnight but
OL,8,Fand a few clear spells are likely.
OL,9,FAnother warm night is expected with
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FTemperatures rising quickly
OL,13,Fduring the morning under strong August
OL,14,Fsunshine. Winds mostly light and
OL,15,Fvariable. Feeling hot, locally very
OL,16,Fhot.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
